---

<section style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Why industries choose Ichibot</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      The hard part of industrial IoT is rarely the dashboard. It is getting a straight
      answer out of equipment that was installed long before anyone thought about data.
    </p>
    <div class="why">
      {
        reasons.map((r) => (
          <div>
            <h3>{r.title}</h3>
            <p>{r.body}</p>
            <span class="anchor">{r.anchor}</span>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
